data: {"content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_18534","logprobs":[],"output_index":1,"sequence_number":174,"text":"Implemented Task 002 while preserving all Task 001 functionality.\n\n### Key Updates\n- Added **`.gitignore`** to exclude SQLite database files, logs, and `node_modules`.\n- Removed the tracked `workboard.db` from the repository and committed the change.\n- Ensured all required UI elements, API endpoints, and persistence behavior are present and functional.\n- Verified clean Git status (`git status --porcelain` shows no changes) and successful server operation.\n\n**Submitted commit ID:** `e5958900ce8230c150ba1811799dead2f0a31f6d`","type":"response.output_text.done"}

